{
"dur": 76.185,
"shots": [
{
"i": 1,
"start": 0.0,
"vo_start": 0.6,
"vo_end": 6.72,
"text": "Then, in late 2022, ChatGPT launched, and every tech company on Earth wanted to build its own AI.",
"end": 6.995
},
{
"i": 2,
"start": 6.995,
"vo_start": 7.27,
"vo_end": 14.347,
"text": "Training those models takes vast data centres full of GPUs. Nvidia's chips, and its CUDA software, were the standard.",
"end": 14.622
},
{
"i": 3,
"start": 14.622,
"vo_start": 14.897,
"vo_end": 24.796,
"text": "Seventeen years of CUDA meant that most AI code was already written for Nvidia. Switching to a rival chip wasn't just buying new hardware; it meant rewriting software.",
"end": 25.071
},
{
"i": 4,
"start": 25.071,
"vo_start": 25.346,
"vo_end": 35.744,
"text": "Nvidia's value climbed in leaps. One trillion dollars in 2023. Three trillion in 2024. Four trillion in July 2025.",
"end": 36.019
},
{
"i": 5,
"start": 36.019,
"vo_start": 36.294,
"vo_end": 40.494,
"text": "Its newer Blackwell chips were sold out long before the factories could make enough of them.",
"end": 40.769
},
{
"i": 6,
"start": 40.769,
"vo_start": 41.044,
"vo_end": 46.644,
"text": "On the twenty-ninth of October 2025, Nvidia became the first company ever worth five trillion dollars.",
"end": 46.919
},
{
"i": 7,
"start": 46.919,
"vo_start": 47.194,
"vo_end": 54.194,
"text": "From a diner booth, a dead-end chip, a favour from Sega, a chip finished with thirty days of cash, and a science project nobody paid for.",
"end": 54.469
},
{
"i": 8,
"start": 54.469,
"vo_start": 54.744,
"vo_end": 59.423,
"text": "Every one of those bets looked mad at the time. Jensen kept making them.",
"end": 59.698
},
{
"i": 9,
"start": 59.698,
"vo_start": 59.973,
"vo_end": 69.212,
"text": "He still runs the company his own way. He has around sixty people reporting directly to him, few one-on-one meetings, and he still talks about the company as if it could die tomorrow.",
"end": 69.487
},
{
"i": 10,
"start": 69.487,
"vo_start": 69.762,
"vo_end": 75.235,
"text": "If you want to see who ends up owning a slice of a company like this, watch our story on BlackRock next.",
"end": 76.185
}
],
